category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Fast integer compression in C using the StreamVByte codec (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "StreamVByte is a new integer compression technique that applies SIMD
instructions (vectorization) to Google's Group Varint approach. The net
result is faster than other byte-oriented compression techniques."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/fast-pack/streamvbyte
